[1.599, "o", "Feedback     Love this sweater, perfect fit and gorgeous color.\r\nTier         low   (low 0.99 | medium 0.01 | high 0.00)\r\nAction       auto_reply   human review: no\r\nTriggers     none\r\nExplanation  The customer is highly satisfied with the sweater's fit and color. The\r\n             models assigned a 99.1% probability to low dissatisfaction, indicating a\r\n             positive feedback.\r\nSource       llm\r\n"]
