[1.589, "o", "Feedback     Pretty dress but the material is not as soft as I hoped.\r\nTier         medium   (low 0.20 | medium 0.60 | high 0.20)\r\nAction       manual_review   human review: yes\r\nTriggers     none\r\nExplanation  The dress is pretty, but the material is not as soft as expected. The\r\n             models assigned a 60.4% probability to medium dissatisfaction, indicating a\r\n             notable but not severe concern about the product quality.\r\nSource       llm\r\n"]
