[1.230, "o", "Feedback     Fell apart in the wash. Worst purchase ever, I want a refund!\r\nTier         high   (low 0.01 | medium 0.03 | high 0.96)\r\nAction       escalate_immediately   human review: yes\r\nTriggers     none\r\nExplanation  The product disintegrated during the first wash. The models assigned a\r\n             95.8% probability to high dissatisfaction, indicating severe product-\r\n             quality issues.\r\nSource       llm\r\n"]
